audit_conclusion:
The Full WOW v1.1 final human-facing walkthrough is PASS. It presents a product-facing closed-evidence story over the completed final rollup, including dirty request, warehouse evidence, Supplier A scoped path, Supplier B blocker, legal/accounting review, real Gemini semantic lane observation, BSEP membrane, DRS/CandidateVector/AVF advisory layers, Semantic Architect/runtime plan artifact boundary, Root review, scoped human approval, Root-created mock packet observation, MockBankSandbox receipt evidence, authority matrix, counters, and non-claims.

The walkthrough observes the final rollup only. It does not rerun Gemini, call provider/network/model APIs, access secrets, create action or receipt artifacts, execute mock or real payment paths, release shipment, call bank/supplier/warehouse APIs, implement v1.2, or claim production/public-auditor readiness.
